{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33193","headline":"白马津阻雨 · 司马扎","name":"白马津阻雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"津树萧萧旅馆空，坐看疎叶绕堦红。\n故乡千里楚云外，归鴈一声烟雨中。\n漳浦病多愁易老，茂陵书在信难通。\n功名傥遂身无事，终向溪头伴钓翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}